& [NeedAndEvidence]
  + published pure consumer67ce99da and bookend02ac91ce prove exact EOF transcript correspondence but do not provide MCP JSONL agent-client inspection
  + official rmcp default async reader is unbounded and encoder lacks output ceiling; library argument limits alone cannot prove transport bounds
  + Tokio stdio blocking work and default runtime drop can outlive cooperative timeouts; explicit owned-runtime shutdown and native proof are necessary

& [SelectedSolution]
  + one tools-only SDK adapter with exact nested wire bytes fixed budgets cancellation and inherited-stream-only native duplication
  + original semantic wire host and consumer stay immutable; new effects are authorized explicitly rather than imported from effect-free predecessors

& [WisdomAndCaution]
  + bound message/session life and active semantic calls before pursuing resident application use
  + preserve raw-byte fixture correspondence and fixed non-echoing fault classification
  + no claims of trusted executable identity inference quality autonomous work or installed app acceptance

